</TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="22" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>| ○○도서관 | 5/22 | - 피난통로 내 물품 적치</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>
